#: ../../tools/ebi_proteins_ext_tools.rst:32 21d492b527324bc1af66f57c888f4548
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get predicted antigenic regions for a protein from the "
"EBI Proteins API. Returns regions of the protein sequence predicted to be"
" immunogenic and suitable for antibody generation. Includes match scores "
"indicating prediction confidence. Critical for antibody design, vaccine "
"development, and immunology research. Example: P04637 (TP53) returns 2 "
"antigenic regions at positions 291-379 and 5-64 with 100% match scores."
msgstr ""

