#: ../../tools/ebi_proteins_ext_tools.rst:128 aadb0c4e2b404c7db2fc0759c5d77542
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get mutagenesis experiment data for a protein from the "
"EBI Proteins API. Returns experimentally characterized mutations with "
"their functional effects, including gain/loss of function, binding "
"changes, and structural impacts. Data is curated from UniProtKB with "
"literature evidence. Essential for understanding structure-function "
"relationships. Example: P04637 (TP53) returns 651 mutagenesis annotations"
" showing effects of each mutation on p53 function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ebi_proteins_ext_tools.rst:132 ae08045c3f0246e285ef5c8f5bd9b71e
